# Gallery slideshow smoke (FrontEnd 69802220,cee3af0d, run with SKIP_FRONTEND=0): `gallery 63` unlocks
# all six galleries (a forced ShowSlideShow with mask 0 faults in retail too), `send e0
# InternalMessage13` is ShowSlideShow. The update counter stops while the slideshow runs (`@f` lines
# after it never fire), so the steps after it are unprefixed (sent once the previous one is
# answered) and the presses hold until the next one (`0` updates): right x3, a, left, then B exits.
@f100 send e0 Unlock
@f110 gallery
@f120 gallery 63
@f200 send e0 InternalMessage13
@3 status
press right 0
press right 0
press right 0
press a 0
press left 0
press b 0
status
